# Frontend Tips and Tooltips (MANDATORY)

Applies whenever you add or change **hints, explainers, odds copy, or hover tips** under `frontend/`, including **modals** (shop, map, detail) and **lists** with long labels.

## Hover tips — markup (MANDATORY)

- Trigger: `class="tooltip-wrap has-tip"` (omit `has-tip` only when the whole block is the hover target, e.g. gold display).
- Body: child `<span class="tooltip-text">...</span>`.
- Do **not** use HTML `title=` for gameplay or explanatory copy.
- Long copy: add **`tooltip-wide`** on `tooltip-text` (`white-space: normal`, max-width).
- Clipped by scroll/overflow above: add **`tooltip-below`** on `tooltip-text`.
- Do **not** use `tooltip-below` for triggers pinned to the **bottom** of the main screen when root layout uses `overflow: hidden` — pop above instead (see gold display pattern in `MainScreen.vue`).

## Hover tips — visual style (MANDATORY)

**Canonical CSS lives in `frontend/src/style.css`. Do not re-declare background, border, shadow, or font on `.tooltip-text` in scoped view CSS.**

| Property | Token / class |
|----------|----------------|
| Background | `var(--tooltip-bg)` (`--bg-darker`) |
| Border | `1px solid var(--tooltip-border)` (`--border`) |
| Radius | `var(--tooltip-radius)` (4px) |
| Shadow | `var(--tooltip-shadow)` (green glow) |
| Text | `var(--text)`, `var(--font-sm)` |
| Trigger hint | `has-tip` → dotted underline `var(--text-muted)` |

**Modifiers (global):**

| Class | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `tooltip-below` | Open downward |
| `tooltip-wide` | Multi-line, max-width wrap |
| `tooltip-float` | Fixed-position shell (Teleport); child `.tooltip-text` is `display: block` |
| `formula-tooltip-floating` | Formula follow-cursor; reuse global `.tooltip-text` |

**Formula / attribute HTML inside tooltips:** use spans with classes `tip-attr-var`, `tip-num`, `tip-op`, `tip-equip-label`, `tip-purpose`, `tip-muted` — colors are global in `style.css`.

**Special shells** (may add layout only, not replace base colors):

- `inventory-slot-tooltip` — fixed item inspect
- `player-stats-chart-tooltip` — chart hover (must still use `--tooltip-*` tokens)

**Prohibited:** white/gray system tooltip look, `background: var(--bg-dark)` on hover popups, black `box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,...)`, per-view duplicate `.tooltip-text { ... }` blocks.

## Persistent in-panel helper blocks (MANDATORY)

Short paragraphs inside modals/panels (e.g. shop quality odds, skill-choice reminders) are **not** plain `text-muted` on the panel root alone. They MUST read as a **nested card**:

- Background: `var(--bg-darker)`
- Border: `1px solid var(--border-dark)`
- Border radius: `6px`
- Padding: about `0.65rem 0.75rem`
- Reuse `detail-skill-choice-banner` / `shop-quality-banner` structure.

Optional `tooltip-wrap has-tip` on a phrase inside the banner is fine; tooltip body still uses global `.tooltip-text` + `tooltip-below` / `tooltip-wide` when needed.

See also: [ui-design.mdc](./ui-design.mdc), [docs/design/11-ui-tokens.md](../../docs/design/11-ui-tokens.md) section 5.3.

## Equipment quality wording (MANDATORY)

When labeling **normal / magic / rare / unique** in UI copy, color with `getQualityColor(...)` and `QUALITY_*` from `equipment.js`. Values in `11-ui-tokens.md` section 1.2.1.
